        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>The last rung of the Arms Advance, gained at 19th level.</em></p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>Every Libra weapon gains a <strong>fifth damage die</strong>, past the game's own cap &mdash; that part is permanent &mdash; and <strong>one property rune of your choice</strong>, re-chosen each morning. This action is that choice.</p><p>The rune applies to all twelve weapons at once and lasts until you choose again tomorrow. A property rune you bought and etched yourself is untouched; only the one Athena's Temper granted last is replaced.</p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Libra — the Weapons] at 19th level.</p>"
        },
